    (71, 've_a4cdd65b30', 'Restaurant & Bar Botschaft', 'Botschaft', 'michelin', 'https://guide.michelin.com/us/en/capital-region/copenhagen/restaurant/botschaft', 'Name-diff evidence line 83 (G3); live "Restaurant & Bar Botschaft"; card h1 "Botschaft"; site read: not read (robots); rule R5; new name = Michelin 2026 card name; Michelin card https://guide.michelin.com/us/en/capital-region/copenhagen/restaurant/botschaft; Ben Oct 30 18:35 ET decision 1 = A (rules R1-R5); read Oct 30'),
